ectors/arxiv/runs/20260907T161121Z/raw/cs-lg.atom"],"source_type":"arxiv_atom_snapshot","summary_text":"Abstract-level arXiv Discovery lead (2608.15224) in lane evaluation. Discovery triage only: matched=evaluation,language_models,retrieval_embeddings,training_methods; title_matches=evaluation,retrieval_embeddings; score=10. Shortlist status is provisional and requires Sol review; no downstream disposition is encoded. Abstract excerpt: Reliable post-hoc evaluation asks whether already generated text satisfies a target criterion after generation. In this paper we study a focused frozen-embedding setting using principle-evaluation proxy tasks: toxicity detection, fine-grained emotion categorization, and ordinal review rating. General-purpose text embeddings are widely deployed for such tasks, but broad semantic similarity can place semantically similar yet task-distinct examples in overlapping regions of the representation space. We introduce Prototype-Guided Contrastive Learning (PGCL), a prototype-guided geometric regulariza","title":"Structuring Semantic Embeddings for Principle Evaluation: A Prototype-Guided Contrastive Learning Approach"}}
