rce_type":"official_research_index_snapshot","summary_text":"Cohere's official blog index lists this Aug 19 Research item and describes a finding that cultural diversity can be lost in post-training data mixes. The current index snapshot is a research lead, not an accepted technical claim.","title":"The Culture Funnel: You can’t align what isn’t in the data"}}
